# Media Rules

ImageKit:
- product images
- product short videos
- application/profile images
- thumbnails
- course thumbnails (application media)

AgriAcademy training videos:
- YouTube Unlisted
- Instructor uploads on YouTube and pastes the URL into AgroConnect
- AgroConnect stores only the YouTube Video ID and course/enrollment metadata
- No local Academy video upload, no Academy video storage, no Bunny for Academy

Supabase stores media metadata (ImageKit) and YouTube Video IDs (Academy lessons).
Provider stores/delivers media.
Do not use Map/Set/global memory as durable media state.
Prefer direct signed uploads for ImageKit.
Never expose provider secrets.

Deleting a course, chapter or lesson must never delete the YouTube video.
Unlisted YouTube URLs can still be shared outside AgroConnect; enrollment gates the in-app learning experience, not the raw URL.
